{"title":"What should I ask Fuchsia Dunlop?","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/971238572/0/marginalrevolution~What-should-I-ask-Fuchsia-Dunlop.html","date":1791708767000,"content":"<p>Yes I will be doing a fourth (!) Conversation with her, based in part on her forthcoming book <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Five-Tastes-Delicious-Recipes-Chinese/dp/1324050705/ref=sr_1_1?crid=MKHL7OFG6CIP&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.TXLJMthLdF6FnmU3eGMJFE2OWyHqgua8Y3y4reYuKU61065mCNwX3dZ27CspHUviQ_-5LSM9gZSvXtxA8yMH00JFaOvw6yUThAn6bjQMrK3Fp9s5DlhpEXlMhgBs3paqPaX0vdmzoXu7-GIAkSkUfie7icQkqPCD1LPhBB03mxvKACfsPV38zMZW5kfltNl1lFiB3fg-1sE9PznFtgD9ntp7LvRr5-w553bZFpU87D4.-EluFSvjgA_fSwatIR-uq6kh8008qCrTYX9__ZYUuz0&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=fuchsia+dunlop+cookbook&amp;qid=1791676413&amp;sprefix=fuchsia%2Caps%2C265&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">Five Tastes: Delicious Recipes for Chinese Flavors</a>.  I am sure it is excellent, and will read it very soon.  Her works are not just great cookbooks, they are among the best books period.</p>\r\n<p>Here are <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.google.com/search?q=tyler+cowen+fuchsia+dunlop+conversation&amp;sca_esv=b84005227b66fbeb&amp;sxsrf=APpeQnsBRIABUfZRKbDLTEpP7XAX0i1nrA%3A1791676538286&amp;source=hp&amp;ei=etDKapilDpe80PEPuYXJqAY&amp;iflsig=ABILxe8AAAAAasreiiImDJuH7RNJ-CMFeQISUgozDOfG&amp;ved=0ahUKEwiYyvSc07CXAxUXHjQIHblCEmUQ4dUDCC8&amp;uact=5&amp;oq=tyler+cowen+fuchsia+dunlop+conversation&amp;gs_lp=Egdnd3Mtd2l6Iid0eWxlciBjb3dlbiBmdWNoc2lhIGR1bmxvcCBjb252ZXJzYXRpb24yBRAhGKABMgUQIRigAUjnRFAAWKA__81wgcJNS4yOS4xNS4yyAeVAYAIAQ&amp;sclient=gws-wiz\" target=\"_blank\">my previous CWTs with Fuchsia</a>.  So what should I ask?</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/10/what-should-i-ask-fuchsia-dunlop-2.html\">What should I ask Fuchsia Dunlop?</a> appeared f